            "detailed_description": "<h1>Edition Comparison</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552520/extras/63f35fd3ff2443f53ed6d4e5fd3a2d30.avif?t=1792530774\" width=600 height=600 /></span></p><br><h1>Gold Edition</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552520/extras/575e6987190d8b7d7a00ef0380d0a267.avif?t=1792530774\" width=600 height=600 /></span><br><br>The Gold Edition features all Deluxe Edition content, plus the season pass, which includes Far Cry® 3. Far Cry® 3 available May 29th with the Far Cry 5 Season Pass.</p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1>Libere Hope County de uma seita apocalíptica fanática liderada por Joseph Seed e a família dele neste jogo de tiro em primeira pessoa no mundo aberto de Montana.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMBATE EXPLOSIVO E VISCERAL</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552520/extras/14d22c269e2c08c0c9b4c889f6d9b3b9.poster.avif?t=1792530774\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552520/extras/14d22c269e2c08c0c9b4c889f6d9b3b9.webm?t=1792530774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552520/extras/14d22c269e2c08c0c9b4c889f6d9b3b9.mp4?t=1792530774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Lute contra a seita usando um arsenal mortífero ou eliminações furtivas letais. De pás para ataques corpo a corpo a lançadores de foguetes, use todas as ferramentas a seu dispor para desmantelar a seita Portão do Éden em combate sangrento.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE UM MUNDO ABERTO DINÂMICO</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552520/extras/c1d7759e90d213371220a05602b0fd32.poster.avif?t=1792530774\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552520/extras/c1d7759e90d213371220a05602b0fd32.webm?t=1792530774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552520/extras/c1d7759e90d213371220a05602b0fd32.mp4?t=1792530774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Explore um vasto horizonte por terra, ar e água. Pilote aviões em duelos aéreos, derrape em terrenos rurais com muscle cars icônicos ou quadriciclos. O mundo reage a tudo que você faz para liberar Hope County do seu jeito.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RECRUTE SEU ESQUADRÃO</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552520/extras/e9b66f89bf344ffea978014886884b7d.poster.avif?t=1792530774\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552520/extras/e9b66f89bf344ffea978014886884b7d.webm?t=1792530774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552520/extras/e9b66f89bf344ffea978014886884b7d.mp4?t=1792530774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Nunca lute sozinho. Recrute Armas de Aluguel, que são rebeldes especializados em suporte tático, ou Garras de Aluguel, como o cachorro Boomer ou o urso X-Burguer para fazer reconhecimento, distrair e mutilar esquadrões inimigos.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >JOGUE A CAMPANHA COMPLETA NO MODO COOPERATIVO</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552520/extras/76dd23be509b0febabd262021b90f5c5.poster.avif?t=1792530774\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552520/extras/76dd23be509b0febabd262021b90f5c5.webm?t=1792530774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552520/extras/76dd23be509b0febabd262021b90f5c5.mp4?t=1792530774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Jogue toda a jornada sozinho ou com um amigo no modo cooperativo para 2 jogadores. Coordenem suas táticas, compartilhem seus arsenais e retomem Hope County juntos.",
            "about_the_game": "Libere Hope County de uma seita apocalíptica fanática liderada por Joseph Seed e a família dele neste jogo de tiro em primeira pessoa no mundo aberto de Montana.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMBATE EXPLOSIVO E VISCERAL</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552520/extras/14d22c269e2c08c0c9b4c889f6d9b3b9.poster.avif?t=1792530774\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552520/extras/14d22c269e2c08c0c9b4c889f6d9b3b9.webm?t=1792530774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552520/extras/14d22c269e2c08c0c9b4c889f6d9b3b9.mp4?t=1792530774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Lute contra a seita usando um arsenal mortífero ou eliminações furtivas letais. De pás para ataques corpo a corpo a lançadores de foguetes, use todas as ferramentas a seu dispor para desmantelar a seita Portão do Éden em combate sangrento.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE UM MUNDO ABERTO DINÂMICO</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552520/extras/c1d7759e90d213371220a05602b0fd32.poster.avif?t=1792530774\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552520/extras/c1d7759e90d213371220a05602b0fd32.webm?t=1792530774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552520/extras/c1d7759e90d213371220a05602b0fd32.mp4?t=1792530774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Explore um vasto horizonte por terra, ar e água. Pilote aviões em duelos aéreos, derrape em terrenos rurais com muscle cars icônicos ou quadriciclos. O mundo reage a tudo que você faz para liberar Hope County do seu jeito.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RECRUTE SEU ESQUADRÃO</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552520/extras/e9b66f89bf344ffea978014886884b7d.poster.avif?t=1792530774\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552520/extras/e9b66f89bf344ffea978014886884b7d.webm?t=1792530774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552520/extras/e9b66f89bf344ffea978014886884b7d.mp4?t=1792530774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Nunca lute sozinho. Recrute Armas de Aluguel, que são rebeldes especializados em suporte tático, ou Garras de Aluguel, como o cachorro Boomer ou o urso X-Burguer para fazer reconhecimento, distrair e mutilar esquadrões inimigos.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >JOGUE A CAMPANHA COMPLETA NO MODO COOPERATIVO</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552520/extras/76dd23be509b0febabd262021b90f5c5.poster.avif?t=1792530774\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552520/extras/76dd23be509b0febabd262021b90f5c5.webm?t=1792530774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/552520/extras/76dd23be509b0febabd262021b90f5c5.mp4?t=1792530774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Jogue toda a jornada sozinho ou com um amigo no modo cooperativo para 2 jogadores. Coordenem suas táticas, compartilhem seus arsenais e retomem Hope County juntos.",
            "short_description": "Lute contra uma seita fanática neste jogo de tiro em primeira pessoa no mundo aberto. Participe de combate intenso, liberte territórios hostis, recrute seguidores leais e aliados animais para liberar Hope County sozinho ou no modo cooperativo para 2 jogadores.",
